OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 20 DEC
OL,4,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,5,     GOn the eve of the Winter
OL,6,     GSolstice, Kate Molleson finds
OL,7,     Gsome tracks for those long, dark
OL,8,     Gwinter nights. And, as usual, the
OL,9,     Gbest and latest in cutting-edge
OL,10,     Gand experimental music.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GThe Swedish Radio Symphony
OL,13,     GOrchestra performs Bruckner's
OL,14,     Gfinal symphony, his 8th, that the
OL,15,     Gcomposer himself regarded as a
OL,16,     Ghighpoint of his compositional
OL,17,     Gachievement.
